  "releaseNotes": "NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.MoralisOASIS v2.0.4\n\nMoralis DB OASIS Provider — bridges the OASIS API to Moralis (Web3 backend-as-a-service) for avatar, holon, and NFT storage with built-in EVM cross-chain support.\n\nWhat's new since v2.0.3\n- chore(omniverse): bump OASIS Hub submodule (install detection) (06c80b0)\n- docs(packages): add missing NuGet guides and release setup sections (77c65ea)\n- fix: dedupe Ceramic/Moralis providers, drop dead HoloWeb shells, wire Orion/ONION (d159120)\n- fix(packaging): explicitly include newly documented package readmes (5be30be)\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/Providers/Blockchain/NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.MoralisOASIS",
